Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "sher@test.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "name": "Sher"
}

###

### 3. Login - Kirish
POST https://web-production-af7ae.up.railway.app/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "sher@test.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### 4. Get User Stats (USER_ID ni replace qil)
GET https://web-production-af7ae.up.railway.app/api/user/stats/USER_ID

###

### 5. Get Puzzles - Mantiq savollarini olish
GET https://web-production-af7ae.up.railway.app/api/puzzles/mantiq?difficulty=oson

###

### 6. Submit Answer - Javobni tekshirish
POST https://web-production-af7ae.up.railway.app/api/submit-answer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "USER_ID",
  "puzzleId": "PUZZLE_ID",
  "answer": "4"
}

###

### 7. Subscribe - Premium-ga o'tish
POST https://web-production-af7ae.up.railway.app/api/subscribe
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "USER_ID",
  "months": 1
}